 *     frosted finish through the passthrough hook `data-finish="glass"`. The
 *     blur scales with `--ds-effect-intensity`, and both
 *     `prefers-reduced-transparency` and forced-colors collapse it to the
 *     opaque card surface. Other roles ignore the hook: glass never nests
