/* Bounded glass finish. Opt-in through the caller-forwarded
   `data-finish="glass"` hook, and only on the roles where the material law
   allows frost: bounded `raised` and `overlay` regions. The blur scales with
   the tenant effect intensity (0 collapses it); the role background channel
   stays the single source of translucency, so an opaque channel renders a
   solid surface with no wasted compositing. */
