   One (0,3,0) rule outranks every hN level above (0,1,1). */
.ds-markdown-view[data-part='root'] [data-part='heading']:lang(ar, fa, ur, ps, sd, ug, ku, ckb, dv, ks) {
  letter-spacing: normal;
}

/* Keyboard-reachable scroll regions (Phase B): the table wrapper and the
   default code fence became focusable in the engine (scrollable-region law);
   their ring shares the family's governed focus grammar. `outline`-free like
   the link ring -- the box-shadow does not move geometry. */
.ds-markdown-view[data-part='root'] [data-part='table-wrapper']:focus-visible,
.ds-markdown-view[data-part='root'] [data-part='code-block-pre']:focus-visible {
  outline: none;
  box-shadow: var(
