   border AND icon tint, never a rail. The dragging frame ALSO swaps dashed
   -> solid: the drag state reads as a frame-grammar change, not hue alone. */
.ds-upload-dragger.ds-upload-dragger--modern [data-part='dropzone']:active:not([data-disabled='true']),
.ds-upload-dragger.ds-upload-dragger--modern [data-part='dropzone'][data-state='dragging'] {
  background: var(--ds-upload-dropzone-bg-active, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-color-primary) 4%, transparent));
}
