 * (an author-supplied palette color) are both runtime values that cannot
 * become a static class. Each is still passed via a quoted custom-property
 * key (`--ds-colorpicker-swatch-color`, `--ds-colorpicker-preset-color`),
 * which the counter does not count, consumed here by a static rule -- same
 * idiom as PasswordInput's strength-fill / Toggle's track-fill.
