        the `flex justify-between` utility: the label truncates on the inline
        track, the chevron/loading dock at the inline end. ---- */
.ds-cascader.ds-cascader--modern[data-part="root"] [data-part="option"] {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  inline-size: 100%;
