 * fill as a `background` (not `accent-color`) repairs gradient `strokeColor`
 * values on the LINE; the circle's conic color-stop still requires a plain
 * color (a gradient there is invalid CSS, as it was under the drained
 * currentColor DaisyUI arc -- documented limitation, not a regression).
 *
