/* Determinate RTL mirroring belongs to `.ds-arc`; indeterminate animation
   owns transform, so only its direction reverses here. */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .rottay-progress-shell.rottay-progress-shell--modern[data-type='circle'][data-indeterminate='true']:dir(rtl)::before {
    animation-direction: reverse;
  }
}

/* Forced colors: native progress parts map to system colors so the fill
   stays visible on any HC theme (K2-V sweep finding: Upload's text-list
   progress rendered invisible under forced-colors). Track -> ButtonFace
   with a ButtonText edge, value -> Highlight; the indeterminate sliding
   bar takes the same ink. The circle's painted pseudos opt out below so
   the conic arc survives the background-image strip. */
