 *
 * Engine-agnostic: both compounds render one tree regardless of the active
 * engine, so they get a single home here rather than an engines/{modern,rustic}/skin pair.
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47). Nothing in this file paints a border colour, so
 * the (0,3,1) tenant border-color floor (P-48) does not apply to any rule here.
 *
 * ===========================================================================
 * PERSONALITY: `.rottay-toast-container > *` -- NO CHANNEL OVERLAP
 * ===========================================================================
