 * emits NO DaisyUI toast placement classes -- those were drained alongside
 * theme.css's `[data-tenant] .toast` bridge, which referenced six
 * `--ds-toast-*` tokens declared nowhere; the fixed positioning/flex stack
 * below is the single paint owner. The provider's `top` prop reaches the
 * paint through the engine-stamped `--ds-message-stack-offset` channel
