 * still yields to a caller's inline `style`.
 *
 * SINGLE PAINT OWNER. The modern engine stamps anatomy only (`data-part`
 * hooks, `data-size`, `data-current`, `aria-current`) — no inline styles, no
 * DaisyUI classes, no Tailwind utilities. The stale "DaisyUI join pattern"
 * docblock this file's previous header warned about was removed from the
 * engine in the same wave; `personality.css`'s PAGINATION block still targets
 * `.ant-pagination-item` / `.join .btn` / `.ds-pagination-item`, none of which
 * this engine stamps, so it stays orphaned exactly as before.
