 * `data-part='root'`. All control parts are anchored under it. The root is
 * one wrapping flex toolbar: the optional range readout (`showTotal`), the
 * joined controls row, and the page-size changer (`showSizeChanger`, a
 * native select in the select.css native-trigger idiom with a governed
 * chevron part) sit inline and wrap as one composition on narrow frames.
 *
 * Pass P2 (Phase B segunda pasada): the disabled size changer dims control
 * and chevron as one unit (`data-disabled` on the wrapper — the chevron is
 * the select's sibling, not its child), and forced-colors adds the ellipsis
 * to the joined frame and remaps the disabled chevron to GrayText.
