     tenant (TMM #FFFEFB; bithire aliases it to its own --ds-surface-card, so
     bithire's white surface is byte-identical). */
  background: var(--ds-tour-surface-bg, var(--ds-material-card-background, var(--ds-surface-card)));
  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--ds-elevation-3);
