 * GLASS: the sticky posture's `backdrop-filter` is opt-in through the
 * `--ds-mobile-header-sticky-backdrop` channel (default `none`) — a default-ON
 * blur taxes every scroll frame (PT29/PT32/S06/S07 fix, Sheet glass precedent).
 *
