 * unlayered (0,3,1) `*` border-color floor at (0,4,0)+.
 *
 * Values transcribed verbatim from `engines/modern.tsx`.
 *
 * SECOND PASS (Phase B): row states (gated hover wash / :active / :focus-within
 * / aria-selected tint+keyline / aria-disabled), size-driven row insets, the
 * vertical itemLayout, empty-slot nested-radius grammar, grid overflow guard
 * and long-copy wrapping were added; the split divider gained ONE bounded
 * prototype axis, `--_ds-proto-list-split-inset-inline` (length, default 0 =
