   with the pending copy, optically centered, logical gap. Ring paint, cadence
   and reduced-motion/forced-colors grammar belong to the Spinner's own skin. */
.rottay-timeline.rottay-timeline--modern[data-part='root'] > [data-part='item'][data-pending='true'] > [data-part='content'] > [data-part='spinner'] {
  display: inline-flex;
