/* ---- forced colors: tone fills strip away, so the rail, the dots and the
        pending node re-assert in system colors. The dot stays a solid marker
        (ButtonText), pending keeps the system highlight, and the connector --
        always a neutral hairline, never a state hue -- reads ButtonText. The
        state keyline is box-shadow paint and strips away with the fills; the
        composed ring re-expresses in the GrayText/Highlight pair (its own
        skin's FC grammar, re-asserted here above the family dial). ---- */
