 * allowlist would silently drop any field type not enumerated in the switch, and
 * the `default` branch exists precisely to catch those. Excluded, because each
 * paints from somewhere else or not at all: textarea and select/multi-select (their
 * own objects, byte-identical paint, kept as separate rules so a future edit to one
 * cannot move the others); color (its own border + radius); and checkbox, switch,
 * radio, slider, rating, which paint NOTHING and render as native UA controls.
