@layer rottay-components {
/**
 * WizardSurface skin (WO-SKIN-06 / CK-D/R, premium pass 2026-07-30).
 *
 * LAYER: imported by `facade/entrypoints/base.css` and
 * `facade/entrypoints/styles.css` into `layer(rottay-components)` (the old
 * "deliberately unlayered" note predates the wiring). `rottay-components`
 * sorts BEFORE `rottay-engines`, so paint the composed engines apply
 * themselves outranks any selector weight here: the two legacy repetition
 * rules were already dead and are retired.
 *
 * SCOPE: the surface composes public primitives and patterns (PageShell,
 * Grid, Card, Text, Button, StepWizard, FormBuilder) — each owns its own
