 *   - Error banner card (`ds-wizard__error-card`): border tint through the
 *     Card engine's bordered border channel. The composed Card already
 *     consumes `--ds-card-bordered-border-color` (outlined variant,
 *     card.css), so this retunes an existing channel — it is NOT a new
 *     token. It lands wherever the resolved tenant variant paints a border,
 *     the same reach the legacy `border-color` rule had.
 *
 *   Description ink moved to the Typography `color="subtle"` prop (the exact
 *   `--ds-color-text-muted` value the dead rule intended) — engine-owned and
 *   tenant-remappable, no skin rule needed.
 *
