   icon (never colour alone); the decorative spark dots and the glow are
   removed (they carry no information); the composed Statistic / Skeleton /
   Progress primitives keep their own forced-colors contracts. */
@media (forced-colors: active) {
  .ds-stats-header[data-part='root'] [data-part='stat-card'][data-accent],
  .ds-stats-header[data-part='root'][data-loading='true'] [data-part='skeleton-card'] {
    border-color: ButtonText;
    background: Canvas;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .ds-stats-header[data-part='root'] [data-part='stat-card'][data-clickable='true']:focus-visible {
    outline-color: Highlight;
  }
  .ds-stats-header[data-part='root'] [data-part='spark-dots'],
  .ds-stats-header[data-part='root'] [data-part='card-glow'] {
    display: none;
  }
}

}
@layer rottay-components {
/** StatsHeader keyframes formerly emitted once per rendered instance.
 *
 * `pulse-card-skeleton` is retired: the loading placeholder is now the
 * composed Skeleton primitive, which owns its own canonical cadence
 * (ds-skeleton-shimmer / ds-skeleton-pulse). Only the sparkline hover ping
 * remains — it is driven purely from CSS (`:hover` on the parent card,
 * staggered on the `--ds-stats-header-ping-duration` channel).
 */

@keyframes pulse-dot-ping {
  0% {
    transform: scale(1);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  50% {
    transform: scale(1.8);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  100% {
    transform: scale(1);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

}
@layer rottay-components {
/**
 * DataTerminalCard skin — engine-agnostic.
 * Home: foundation/tokens/css/presentation/components/skin/data-terminal-card.css.
 * The component renders one DOM tree under every engine (no engines/ split), so
 * it has a single skin covering BOTH of its scope classes:
 * `ds-data-terminal-card` (the four variant bodies, selected by `data-variant`
 * 1..4) and `ds-data-terminal-stat` (DataTerminalStat).
 *
 * LAYERING: imported by `facade/entrypoints/base.css` into
 * `layer(rottay-components)` — this file does not control its own layering
 * (the older "deliberately unlayered" note predates that wiring). Caller
 * inline `style` still wins over every rule here.
 *
 * SCOPE ROOT carries a SINGLE class (`ds-data-terminal-card` OR
 * `ds-data-terminal-stat`) plus ALWAYS-PRESENT contract attributes:
 * `data-part='root'` + `data-variant` (card only) + `data-trend` +
 * `data-band` (both roots — the stat root now stamps it too). Class/attribute
 * REPETITION IS PROHIBITED, so the specificity budget the old selectors bought
 * by repeating `data-part` up to four times is now bought from those
 * always-present attributes (fragility documented: if an engine ever stops
 * stamping one, the affected rules silently lose to the floors):
 *   - NON-BORDER paint on a Box/icon: (0,3,0) = class + `data-part='root'` +
 *     the descendant part.
 *   - A BORDER COLOR: (0,4,0) = class + root + one contract attr + the part.
 *   - `color` on a composed `Text` (must match the Typography skin's (0,4,0)
 *     and win the tie as the later file): (0,5,0) = class + root + two
 *     contract attrs + the part.
 * `border: none`/width-only resets carry no color and are exempt — none here.
 *
 * STATE: `getProgressColor(progress)` is a threshold bucket over static tokens
 * and is STATE-SELECTED, so it stays rules keyed on the stamped `data-band`
 * (high -> success, mid -> warning, low -> error). `trendColor` is the binary
 * `trend === 'up' ? success : error` and stays keyed on `data-trend`.
 *
 * MOTION: every animation/transition is owned HERE (the inline declarations
 * left the engine because an inline animation cannot be reduced-motion
 * silenced without `!important`). Durations ride INTERNAL cadence channels,
 * each derived from the `--ds-motion-glacial` rung:
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-entrance  = ×0.8 (0.4s, card fade-in)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-tick      = ×2   (1s,   data-tick/typing/details pulse)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-pulse     = ×4   (2s,   live/node/shimmer pulse)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-heartbeat = ×3   (1.5s, heartbeat dots)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-drift     = ×6   (3s,   HUD corner brackets)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-ambient   = ×8   (4s,   breathe/slide textures)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-scan      = ×10  (5s,   HUD scan line)
 *   --ds-dtc-duration-flow      = ×80  (40s,  matrix texture flow)
 * Stagger delays reuse the same channels (no motion literals anywhere) except
 * the activity-bar's runtime-computed per-index delay, which stays inline.
 *
 * RUNTIME HATCHES (quoted custom-property keys set inline, consumed here):
 *   - `--ds-dtc-live`  — LiveIndicator's ring colour is caller-passed
 *     (CircuitCard passes the band-derived progress colour, MatrixCard
 *     passes success). Computed from data, so no enumerable rule holds it.
 *   - `--ds-dtc-radius` — ProgressBar's `border-radius: height / 2` is
 *     computed from a runtime `height` prop; the track sets it and both
 *     track + fill read it.
 *
 * SAME-PART STATIC SIBLINGS: the three terminal-dots and the corner-brackets
 * share one `data-part` each with no distinguishing stamp, so they are
 * selected by scope-anchored `:nth-child` — byte-exact for these hardcoded,
 * fixed-order decorative siblings.
 *
 * HOVER LAW: the card is a full-body link and quick actions are buttons, so
 * their hovers are hover-capable-only (`@media (hover: hover)`) with a
 * matching `:active`.
 *
 * FORCED COLORS: system colors only — the progress WIDTH carries the data
 * (never its hue), trend reads by icon shape + text, band/status read by
 * their text labels, and the decorative textures/scan/flow/activity/cursor
 * layers step out entirely. No forced-color-adjust opt-out anywhere.
 *
 * Values transcribed verbatim from index.tsx (the `DS` token map + the two
 * threshold/binary selectors).
 */

/* ============================================================================
 * ROOT surface (card + stat) — background + 1px border. Uniform across all
 * four card variants and the stat. The entrance fade is skin-owned (MOTION).
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background);
  animation: dtc-fade-in
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-entrance, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 0.8))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-out, ease-out);
  transition: border-color var(--ds-motion-fast, 120ms) var(--ds-motion-ease-out, ease-out);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background);
}
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* The card is a full-body link: a quiet border shift on hover (hover-capable
   only) and press, never a lift or glow. */
@media (hover: hover) {
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root']:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-color-primary) 28%, var(--ds-color-border));
  }
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root']:active {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-color-primary) 28%, var(--ds-color-border));
}

/* ============================================================================
 * SHARED CROSS-VARIANT parts — same paint wherever the part appears.
 * ==========================================================================*/

/* value (Text) — all four bodies + stat, always text-primary, tabular. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='value'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend][data-band] [data-part='value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* trend-icon (supplier-independent, currentColor) — binary on data-trend, all five bodies. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-trend='up'] [data-part='trend-icon'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-trend='up'] [data-part='trend-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-trend='down'] [data-part='trend-icon'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-trend='down'] [data-part='trend-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-error);
}

/* change-value (Text) — binary on data-trend, all five bodies. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-trend='up'][data-band] [data-part='change-value'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend='up'][data-band] [data-part='change-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-trend='down'][data-band] [data-part='change-value'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend='down'][data-band] [data-part='change-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-error);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* target-value (Text) — threshold bucket on the root's data-band. Command/Circuit/Matrix. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='high'][data-trend] [data-part='target-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='mid'][data-trend] [data-part='target-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-warning);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='low'][data-trend] [data-part='target-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-error);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* period-value (Text) — text-secondary in Command/Circuit/Matrix, text-subtle in HUD. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='1'][data-trend] [data-part='period-value'],
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='3'][data-trend] [data-part='period-value'],
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='4'][data-trend] [data-part='period-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='2'][data-trend] [data-part='period-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-subtle);
}

/* header icon-box (Box) — HUD/Circuit/Matrix, subtle background + 1px border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='header-icon-box'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='header-icon-box'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* header-icon — HUD/Circuit/Matrix, text-secondary. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='header-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}

/* header-label (Text) — HUD/Circuit/Matrix, text-secondary. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='header-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}

/* details-label (Text) — HUD/Matrix, text-muted. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='details-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

/* details-arrow — HUD/Matrix, text-muted. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='details-arrow'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

/* section-divider — the header-section bottom rule in HUD/Circuit/Matrix. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='section-divider'] {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* ============================================================================
 * SHARED SUBCOMPONENTS — LiveIndicator, ActivityIndicator, QuickAction,
 * ProgressBar, StatItem. Same DOM wherever composed.
 * ==========================================================================*/

/* LiveIndicator rings — colour is caller-passed via the --ds-dtc-live hatch. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='live-pulse-ring'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--ds-dtc-live);
  animation: dtc-live-pulse
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-pulse, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 4))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='live-ring'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--ds-dtc-live);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='live-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

/* ActivityIndicator bars — Command/Circuit/Matrix, success. The per-index
   stagger delay stays inline (runtime value); the cadence is owned here. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='activity-bar'] {
  border-radius: 1px;
  background: var(--ds-color-success);
  animation: dtc-data-tick
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-tick, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 2))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}

/* QuickAction button — Command/Circuit (DEAD affordance; contract gap). */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='quick-action'] {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
  transition:
    background-color var(--ds-motion-fast, 120ms) var(--ds-motion-ease-out, ease-out),
    color var(--ds-motion-fast, 120ms) var(--ds-motion-ease-out, ease-out);
}
@media (hover: hover) {
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='quick-action']:hover {
    background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
  }
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='quick-action']:active {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='quick-action-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='quick-action-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

/* StatItem label (Text) — Command/Circuit/Matrix, text-subtle. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='stat-item-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-subtle);
}

/* ProgressBar — track background + fill band background + shimmer. Card + stat.
 * The radius rides the --ds-dtc-radius hatch (height/2, runtime). The fill's
 * width transition and the shimmer cadence are owned here (MOTION). */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-track'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-track'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-border);
  border-radius: var(--ds-dtc-radius);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'] {
  border-radius: var(--ds-dtc-radius);
  transition: width
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-tick, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 2))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='high'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='high'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='mid'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='mid'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='low'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='low'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-error);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-shimmer'],
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-shimmer'] {
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    transparent,
    color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-color-text-on-primary) 20%, transparent),
    transparent
  );
  animation: dtc-wave
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-pulse, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 4))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}

/* ============================================================================
 * VARIANT 1 — CommandCard (terminal).
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-bar'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-bar'] {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* terminal-dots — three hardcoded, fixed-order decorative siblings (the
 * traffic-light dots): position IS the meaning and they never reorder, so a
 * scope-anchored :nth-child is byte-exact here. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-dot'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-dot']:nth-child(1) {
  background: var(--ds-color-error);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-dot']:nth-child(2) {
  background: var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-dot']:nth-child(3) {
  background: var(--ds-color-success);
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='1'][data-trend] [data-part='terminal-filename'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

/* heartbeat-dot — threshold bucket on the root's data-band. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='heartbeat-dot'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: dtc-heartbeat
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-heartbeat, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 3))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='high'] [data-part='heartbeat-dot'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='mid'] [data-part='heartbeat-dot'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='low'] [data-part='heartbeat-dot'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-error);
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='prompt-header'] {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='prompt-symbol'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='prompt-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='prompt-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='cursor'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  animation: dtc-typing
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-tick, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 2))
    step-end infinite;
}

/* Command stats-grid — top border only. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='1'] [data-part='stats-grid'] {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* actions-footer — subtle background + top border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='actions-footer'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* ============================================================================
 * VARIANT 2 — HUDCard (heads-up display).
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='grid-texture'] {
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--ds-color-border) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ds-color-border) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 20px 20px;
  animation: dtc-breathe
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-ambient, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 8))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='scan-line'] {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--ds-color-border-subtle), transparent);
  animation: dtc-scan
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-scan, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 10))
    linear infinite;
}

/* corner-brackets — four fixed siblings (nth-child 3..6, after grid-texture +
 * scan-line), each an L of 2px lines. The drift cadence and the per-corner
 * stagger are owned here; delays reuse the cadence channels (no literals). */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='corner-bracket'] {
  animation: dtc-pulse
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-drift, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 6))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='corner-bracket']:nth-child(3) {
  border-top: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='corner-bracket']:nth-child(4) {
  border-top: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  border-right: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  animation-delay: var(--ds-dtc-duration-entrance, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 0.8));
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='corner-bracket']:nth-child(5) {
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  animation-delay: var(--ds-dtc-duration-tick, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 2));
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='2'] [data-part='corner-bracket']:nth-child(6) {
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  border-right: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  animation-delay: var(--ds-dtc-duration-heartbeat, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 3));
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='2'][data-trend] [data-part='tracking-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-subtle);
}

/* status-badge — subtle background + band-coloured border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='status-badge'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='high'] [data-part='status-badge'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='mid'] [data-part='status-badge'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='low'] [data-part='status-badge'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-error);
}

/* status-dot — band background. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='status-dot'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: dtc-heartbeat
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-heartbeat, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 3))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='high'] [data-part='status-dot'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='mid'] [data-part='status-dot'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='low'] [data-part='status-dot'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-error);
}

/* status-label (Text) — band colour. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='high'][data-trend] [data-part='status-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='mid'][data-trend] [data-part='status-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='low'][data-trend] [data-part='status-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-error);
}

/* trend-badge — subtle background + trend-coloured border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='trend-badge'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-trend='up'] [data-part='trend-badge'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-trend='down'] [data-part='trend-badge'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-error);
}

/* stats-panel — subtle background + 1px border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='stats-panel'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='stats-panel'] {
  border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='2'][data-trend] [data-part='completion-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-subtle);
}

/* completion-value (Text) — band colour. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='high'][data-trend] [data-part='completion-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='mid'][data-trend] [data-part='completion-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-warning);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='low'][data-trend] [data-part='completion-value'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-error);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* details-icon (activity glyph) — always success. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='details-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-success);
  animation: dtc-pulse
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-tick, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 2))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}

/* ============================================================================
 * VARIANT 3 — CircuitCard (circuit board).
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='3'] [data-part='circuit-pattern'] {
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 8px 8px, var(--ds-color-border) 2px, transparent 2px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 7px, var(--ds-color-border) 7px, var(--ds-color-border) 8px, transparent 8px),
    linear-gradient(transparent 7px, var(--ds-color-border) 7px, var(--ds-color-border) 8px, transparent 8px);
  background-size: 32px 32px;
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='3'] [data-part='flow-line'] {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--ds-color-success), transparent);
  animation: dtc-slide
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-ambient, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 8))
    linear infinite;
}

/* node-dots — three uniform indicators (subtle background + 2px border);
 * pulse cadence owned here, per-node stagger reuses the cadence channels. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='node-dot'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--ds-color-background-subtle);
  animation: dtc-pulse
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-pulse, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 4))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='3'] [data-part='node-dot']:nth-child(5) {
  animation-delay: var(--ds-dtc-duration-tick, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 2));
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='3'] [data-part='node-dot']:nth-child(6) {
  animation-delay: var(--ds-dtc-duration-entrance, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 0.8));
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='node-dot'] {
  border: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

/* node-dot-live — band background. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='node-dot-live'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: dtc-heartbeat
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-heartbeat, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 3))
    var(--ds-motion-ease-in-out, ease-in-out) infinite;
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='high'] [data-part='node-dot-live'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-success);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='mid'] [data-part='node-dot-live'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-warning);
}
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-band='low'] [data-part='node-dot-live'] {
  background: var(--ds-color-error);
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='3'][data-trend] [data-part='metric-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-subtle);
}

/* Circuit stats-grid — top + bottom border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='3'] [data-part='stats-grid'] {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* ============================================================================
 * VARIANT 4 — MatrixCard (data grid).
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-variant='4'] [data-part='matrix-texture'] {
  background-image: radial-gradient(var(--ds-color-border) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 12px 12px;
  animation: dtc-flow
    var(--ds-dtc-duration-flow, calc(var(--ds-motion-glacial, 500ms) * 80))
    linear infinite;
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='4'][data-trend] [data-part='datapoint-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-subtle);
}

/* Matrix stats-grid — top + bottom border. */
.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='4'] [data-part='stats-grid'] {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

.ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='4'] [data-part='progress-section'] {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-border);
}

/* ============================================================================
 * DataTerminalStat — own scope class. Value / trend-icon / change-value /
 * ProgressBar are shared (above). Stat-only parts below.
 * ==========================================================================*/

/* corner-brackets — two fixed siblings (nth-child 1..2), each an L of 2px lines. */
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend] [data-part='corner-bracket']:nth-child(1) {
  border-top: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}
.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend] [data-part='corner-bracket']:nth-child(2) {
  border-top: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
  border-right: 2px solid var(--ds-color-text-muted);
}

.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='stat-icon'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}

.ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend][data-band] [data-part='stat-label'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);
}

/* ============================================================================
 * REDUCED MOTION — every ambient loop and entrance goes still; the card
 * reads on its static tones alone.
 * ==========================================================================*/
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='live-pulse-ring'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='activity-bar'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='heartbeat-dot'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='cursor'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='grid-texture'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='scan-line'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='corner-bracket'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='status-dot'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='details-icon'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='flow-line'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='node-dot'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='node-dot-live'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='matrix-texture'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-shimmer'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-shimmer'] {
    animation: none;
  }

  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='quick-action'] {
    transition: none;
  }
}

/* ============================================================================
 * FORCED COLORS — system colors only. The progress WIDTH carries the data
 * (never its hue); trend reads by icon shape + text; band/status read by
 * their text labels; decorative textures/scan/flow/activity/cursor step out.
 * ==========================================================================*/
@media (forced-colors: active) {
  /* frames */
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='header-icon-box'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='section-divider'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='quick-action'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='stats-panel'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='actions-footer'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='1'] [data-part='terminal-bar'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='1'] [data-part='stats-grid'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='3'] [data-part='stats-grid'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='4'] [data-part='stats-grid'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant='4'] [data-part='progress-section'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant] [data-part='prompt-header'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='high'] [data-part='status-badge'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='mid'] [data-part='status-badge'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-band='low'] [data-part='status-badge'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-trend='up'] [data-part='trend-badge'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-trend='down'] [data-part='trend-badge'] {
    border-color: ButtonText;
  }

  /* data readout: progress by width on a system frame, fill in system accent */
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-track'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-track'] {
    background: Canvas;
    border: 1px solid ButtonText;
  }
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='high'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='mid'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='low'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='high'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='mid'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-fill'][data-band='low'] {
    background: Highlight;
  }

  /* dots, rings and bars read in system ink (their background IS the glyph) */
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='status-dot'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='heartbeat-dot'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='node-dot-live'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='terminal-dot'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='live-pulse-ring'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='live-ring'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='activity-bar'] {
    background-color: ButtonText;
  }

  /* semantic hues flatten on text and icons (matching the base rules'
     specificity so these win inside forced colors): shape (up/down arrow)
     and the label text carry trend and band; the UA forces any remaining
     ink to system values regardless. */
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='change-value'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'][data-trend][data-band] [data-part='change-value'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='target-value'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='completion-value'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='status-label'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'][data-variant][data-trend] [data-part='prompt-symbol'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='trend-icon'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='trend-icon'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='details-icon'] {
    color: CanvasText;
  }

  /* decorative layers step out */
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='grid-texture'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='scan-line'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='circuit-pattern'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='matrix-texture'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='flow-line'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-shimmer'],
  .ds-data-terminal-stat[data-part='root'] [data-part='progress-shimmer'],
  .ds-data-terminal-card[data-part='root'] [data-part='cursor'] {
    display: none;
  }
}

}
@layer rottay-components {
/**
 * DataTerminalCard animation contract.
 *
 * Names and frame bodies intentionally match the former module-scope DOM style
 * injector because the component's runtime animation strings are public paint
 * behavior. Keeping them in the canonical CSS bundle makes SSR deterministic
 * and removes the import-time document mutation.
 */

@keyframes dtc-fade-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-pulse {
  0%, 100% {
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-heartbeat {
  0%, 100% {
    transform: scale(1);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  50% {
    transform: scale(1.2);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-breathe {
  0%, 100% {
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-scan {
  0% {
    transform: translateY(-100%);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  100% {
    transform: translateY(300%);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-glow {
  0%, 100% {
    box-shadow: 0 0 2px currentColor;
  }
  50% {
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px currentColor, 0 0 12px currentColor;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-slide {
  0% {
    transform: translateX(-100%);
  }
  100% {
    transform: translateX(400%);
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-blink {
  0%, 90%, 100% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  95% {
    opacity: 0.2;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-live-pulse {
  0%, 100% {
    transform: scale(1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 currentColor;
  }
  50% {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px transparent;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-data-tick {
  0%, 100% {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  10% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  20% {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-wave {
  0% {
    transform: translateX(-100%);
  }
  100% {
    transform: translateX(100%);
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-typing {
  0%, 100% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-flow {
  0% {
    background-position: 0 0;
  }
  100% {
    background-position: 40px 40px;
  }
}

@keyframes dtc-number-glow {
  0%, 100% {
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px currentColor;
  }
  50% {
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px currentColor, 0 0 30px currentColor;
  }
}

}
@layer rottay-components {
/**
 * Assistant skin — engine-agnostic, DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47).
 * Home: foundation/tokens/css/presentation/components/skin/assistant.css. The kit has no engine split
 * and no single root: eight independently-exported sub-components
 * (AssistantStatusBadge, StreamingText, TypingIndicator, ToolCallCard,
 * AssistantStatusIndicator, PreviewDiffCard, ConfirmActionCard, MessageBubble),
 * each its own scope island carrying `ds-assistant-<export>` on its own root
 * plus `data-part` on every painted descendant. AssistantStatusBadge and
 * ConfirmActionCard own no paint of their own (badge tone rides Tag's variant
 * prop; ConfirmActionCard's controls ride Button's variant prop) and have no
 * rules here.
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47): every `rottay-*` layer sorts before
 * Tailwind's base layer, so a layered rule loses to preflight regardless of
 * specificity. Unlayered outranks preflight and still yields to a caller's
 * inline `style`.
 *
 * CARD-ROOTED EXPORTS (P-79 precision): ToolCallCard, PreviewDiffCard, and
 * ConfirmActionCard render a `<Card>` whose root always carries the FORCED
 * `data-part='root'` Card sets internally -- a custom part passed in never
 * lands there, only `className` merges. Their scope class rides `className`
 * (works); none of the three paints its own Card root, so no rule here
 * targets `[data-part='root']` on these exports. All their painted elements
 * are inner Box/Text/Stack descendants that forward the part passed to them.
 *
 * SPECIFICITY (P-48), single scope class per export (0,1,0):
 *   - NON-BORDER paint on a Box (background, border-radius) reaches (0,3,0)
 *     with the class + the descendant `data-part` repeated once (class(1) +
 *     part(2) = 3), or class + part + a state attribute (class(1) + part(1)
 *     + attr(1) = 3) when a state selector is already in play. No Typography
 *     competitor exists for Box paint.
 *   - `color` on a composed `Text` must EXCEED the Typography engine skins'
 *     own `[data-color='default']` rule, which both modern and rustic ship at
 *     (0,4,0) (`.rottay-typography.rottay-typography--<engine>
 *     .rottay-typography--<engine>[data-color='default']`) -- every Text here
 *     renders with an unset `color` prop, so it always carries
 *     `data-color='default'` and always competes. Reaching (0,5,0) needs
 *     class + descendant part repeated to four (class(1) + part(4) = 5), or
 *     class + part(3) + a state attribute (class(1) + part(3) + attr(1) = 5).
 *     State-keyed overrides on the SAME channel as an unqualified base rule
 *     are bumped one unit further (part repeated one more time) so the
 *     override strictly exceeds the base instead of tying on source order.
 *   - A BORDER COLOR must reach (0,4,0): class + descendant part repeated to
 *     three (class(1) + part(3) = 4). PreviewDiffCard's row divider is the
 *     one border-color site in this file.
 *
 * STATE: `data-status` (AssistantStatusIndicator's dot, the agent-activity
 * 5-way), `data-tone` (ToolCallCard's terminal duration text, the tool-status
 * 4-way), `data-change` + `data-diff-side` together (PreviewDiffCard's
 * before/after cells -- the SAME `change` value maps to a DIFFERENT color per
 * side, so both attributes are required to disambiguate; see the divergent
 * before/after mapping below).
 *
 * PreviewDiffCard's after-cell `unchanged` case sets no inline `color` in the
 * TSX (falls through to the Typography default) and correspondingly has no
 * rule here -- adding one would change, not preserve, the rendered color.
 *
 * Values transcribed verbatim from index.tsx's `agentStatusVisual`,
 * `toneToColorVar` (now removed -- both were pure paint-value lookups
 * superseded by these state-keyed rules; `agentStatusVisual`'s `live` and
 * `defaultLabel` fields remain in the TSX, only unused for paint) and the
 * `beforeColor`/`afterColor` ternaries in `PreviewDiffCard`. No hardcoded
 * literals in this file -- every value is a `--ds-color-*` token.
 */

/* ============================================================================
 * Keyframes -- already `ds-`-namespaced and fleet-unique in the TSX, moved
 * here verbatim. `ds-assistant-dot` is shared by TypingIndicator's three dots
 * and AssistantStatusIndicator's single dot; one declaration covers both.
 * ==========================================================================*/

@keyframes ds-assistant-caret {
  0%, 49% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  50%, 100% {
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes ds-assistant-dot {
  0%, 80%, 100% {
    opacity: 0.35;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  40% {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
}

/* ============================================================================
 * StreamingText -- caret.
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-assistant-streaming-text [data-part='caret'][data-part='caret'][data-part='caret'][data-part='caret'] {
  color: var(--ds-color-primary-500);
}

/* ============================================================================
 * TypingIndicator -- three bouncing dots (Box, no Typography competition).
 * ==========================================================================*/

.ds-assistant-typing-indicator [data-part='typing-dot'][data-part='typing-dot'] {
  border-radius: 50%;
