        (0,5,0) via their doubled data-part selector; this (0,5,0) hook
        (class + part + open + placement + the always-present dialog role)
        ties them and wins by later import order. Width and body padding are
        NOT here: they travel the engine's surfaceStyle/bodyStyle channels
        because the rustic Sheet stamps an inline 380px width. ---- */
.ds-widget-board__catalog-surface[data-part='surface'][data-open='true'][data-placement='right'][role='dialog'] {
  border-inline-start: 1px solid
    var(--ds-surface-card-border-strong, var(--ds-color-border-primary));
  background: radial-gradient(
      circle at 100% 0%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-color-primary) 8%, transparent),
