        Button primitive's `cursor: pointer` (0,3,0, this layer) through the
        always-stamped data-loading hook — no `!important`, no double. ---- */
.ds-pattern-widget-board[data-part='root'][data-moving='true'][data-loading],
.ds-pattern-widget-board[data-part='root'][data-moving='true'][data-loading]
