 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47): named DS layers sort before the consumer base
 * layer. Private BEM landing classes isolate caller-supplied plan headers, and
 * every real border color reaches at least (0,4,0) over the tenant floor.
 * Values and the monthly/yearly, highlighted/plain, CTA, badge, and tri-state
