 * `facade/entrypoints/styles.css` (~l.637) into `layer(rottay-components)`,
 * alongside the sibling experience surface skins. The old "deliberately
 * unlayered" note predates the wiring and is retired: the two unlayered
 * color rules it justified (muted/destructive text, built on the forbidden
 * `[data-part='root'][data-part='root']` repetition idiom) are REMOVED, not
 * re-layered — their ink now travels through Typography's own `color`
