 * SCOPE: the surface composes public primitives and helpers (PageShell,
 * Card, Tag, Switch, Tabs, Badge, Pagination, Heading, the surface state
 * kits) — each owns its chrome, interaction states and forced-colors
 * treatment, so this file paints ONLY what the surface itself owns:
 *   - the read/unread recession of feed items (opacity on the pinned
 *     `--read`/`data-read` anatomy, never a decorative accent rail);
 *   - rhythm offsets the markup cannot express (item action row,
