 * (two distinct classes + one attribute, (0,3,0); class/attribute repetition
 * is prohibited — the border-colour rules reach the tenant floor from this
 * scope + a single target part, never a repeated attribute).
 *
 * COMPOSITION LAW: the toolbar composes Button primitives (previous / next /
